    "specPath": "specs/212-rustix-moves-to-1-1-6-for-rustsec-2026-0486/spec.md",
    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "`cargo audit` in the required `supply-chain` job refused `main`'s locked tree: RUSTSEC-2026-0486 names `rustix` 1.1.4, which `tempfile` pulls in as a dev-dependency, so every pull request failed that job. Pull request #536 moved the lock to `rustix` 1.1.6, the semver-compatible fix, and moved the crate's `cargo vet` exemption to the same version, as spec 205 did for its three crates. This spec records that change.\n",
    "title": "rustix moves to 1.1.6 for RUSTSEC-2026-0486"
